<title>USA: Consolidated Delivery names chairman/CEO.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Delivery names chairman/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Delivery &amp; Logistics Inc said Thursday it had named Albert Van Ness chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>He succeeds John Mattei, who last September announced plans to leave the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Van Ness, 54, has served as chairman of the executive committee since April 1996 and chairman of the audit committee since January 1996, the company said.</p>
<p>Prior to that, he was executive vice president and operating director of Cunard Line Ltd's Passenger Ship and Hotel Leisure Division.</p>
</text>
